  "description": "CR 717.2a / 701.25a / 509.1b / 510.2: Gossip's Talent surveils 1 when a creature you control enters, at level 2 makes target attacking creature with power 3 or less unblockable, and at level 3 may flicker a creature that dealt combat damage to a player",
